2 subtasks can create board tasks (t1, t2), but at most one subtask in a plan may. Give every board task this request needs to ONE subtask — it can open several in a single run — and for the others either drop them or list tool_names without create_board_task, which is what marks a subtask as not creating records (a subtask with no tool_names inherits its agent's whole toolset and counts as a creator)